            <div xml:id="d1696">

                <pb facs="1385" n="1269" xml:id="pg1269"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 834.00/108.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 42, Paraguay.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-08-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose copy of a
                    despatch received from the consul at Asuncion relative to the condition of
                    affairs in Paraguay. As the Department will perceive, Consul Ferris does not
                    venture to make any prediction regarding the turn which events may take in the
                    future.</p>
                <p>The newspapers of Montevideo and Buenos Aires usually contain telegrams from
                    Asuncion, but the state of affairs in Paraguay appears so confused that, having
                    no knowledge of that country at first hand, I do not feel competent to do
                    otherwise than transmit the reports sent me by Consul Ferris without
                    comment.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Campbell Turner.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1696-a1.xml" xpointer="d1696-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
